  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Scandinavian radio atelier",
    "overview": "A quiet, tactile radio for a tablet in the living room. Warm paper surrounds a pine-green display, walnut enclosure, cream controls, and restrained oxide accents. Serif headings carry the retro character; familiar sans-serif controls support everyday use.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
